Package: firewallo
Version: 2.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), iptables, nftables
Recommends: suricata
Maintainer: Matteo Fioriti <fioritim@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/un1x80/firewallo
Description: Firewall manager for Debian GNU/Linux
 Firewallo is a zone-based firewall manager for Debian GNU/Linux
 supporting both iptables and nftables backends. It provides a CLI
 tool, a REST API, and a web interface for managing firewall rules,
 NAT, mangle, DPI, and VPN configurations.
